{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_title", "source_sha256": "593e2a3931849d8b1a5064f4ad522b82c8469d222d719d4c54f61128d83fc7a3", "ja": "あなたがいてくれるから", "zh": "因为有你在", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_synopsis", "source_sha256": "90ed499a66e6ba6c29fd2ea2d3c2e98eb2f88f4653ba21960349fc53cedb8720", "ja": "「春香に恋をしている」というファンから\r\n手紙をもらう春香。その気持ちには答えられ\r\nないし、もし自分に好きな人ができたら……\r\n等思い悩んだ末、「アイドルとして、ずっと\r\nファンの傍にいる」という答えを出す。", "zh": "春香收到了一封粉丝来信，上面写着\n“我恋慕着春香”。她既无法回应这份心意，\n又在苦恼如果自己有了喜欢的人该怎么办……\n一番思索后，她给出的答案是“作为偶像，\n要一直陪伴在粉丝身边”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "87cc5e61de89dd3dcededd4c6931121cd4f45263de66ee3eeb522a4bf71e2ff0", "ja": "春香さん、休憩終わりだそうです！\n次はソロ曲の……春香さん？", "zh": "春香小姐，休息时间结束了！\n接下来是独唱曲的……春香小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "9e3fde93d5e40ff207c8f414e6cb97ee09fbf5dc6d6c0a5b25d69e57f4e3dd63", "ja": "……え？　ああっ、ごめんね可奈ちゃん！\nちょっと、考えごとしちゃってたみたい。", "zh": "……诶？啊，对不起，可奈！\n刚才好像一不小心想事情想入神了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "9cef589857393ca364710b1f77f8d71a342cdf230ffa817c49b7d712713fe596", "ja": "最近のハルカ、よくボーッとしてるよネ。\nあのお手紙のコトがあってから……。", "zh": "最近的春香，经常发呆呢。\n自从那封信的事之后……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f1276a8bddca86b34cf1623e5ae15a6cb072b24ec5666a887e6e23801c7d9366", "ja": "うん……アタシも、すこし気になってた。\nやっぱり、ショックだったよね？", "zh": "嗯……我也稍微有点在意。\n果然还是受到了打击吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "3cb6554bc6d01f2b1698fc1f3b3e76785bd1fd6bb9637cbd5431159c88790595", "ja": "ううん、そういうわけじゃないんだけど……。\nでも、考えるきっかけにはなったのかな。", "zh": "不是，不是那样……只是……\n不过，或许也让我有了思考的契机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "79bfcb5b8051a812facd603a0f94296a801129bc0caa2998658364c9d67d93a3", "ja": "気になることがあるなら、なんでも話してよ。\n今さらボク達に遠慮なんてしないでほしいな、春香！", "zh": "如果你有什么在意的事，尽管告诉我吧。\n都到现在了，就别再对我们有所顾虑了，春香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "6853c021805316c8d3390f94232b449e348faa3d9ce6eebed2d9eb8279919a9a", "ja": "そう……？　それじゃあ、えっと\nみんなに、聞いてみたいんだけど……。", "zh": "这样……？那我想问问大家，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "c60c1c2cc117450786acaec41a084daa3690cec57e9a6f9c3b353a427669f994", "ja": "あのね。\n……もし、好きな人ができたら、どうする？", "zh": "那个……\n……如果有了喜欢的人，你会怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "a1e850cf27bdd480b323a8a7aebb466ff6bf69ae612092b8180bfc16452ecbd6", "ja": "あっ、好きな人……っていうか、\n憧れの人、くらいでもいいんだけど。", "zh": "啊，喜欢的人……或者说，\n只是憧憬的人，也可以啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "bea2d05f0402c96e4c77aa78408501af439ab4fe862c6f5367a21f2de0860db8", "ja": "す、好きな人……ですかっ！？", "zh": "喜、喜欢的人……吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "a43f24e88f4a8d6bb1d965d2cc380460d128f8fea18b0b04a6ab75c9a2c107ec", "ja": "ワタシは家族も、劇場のみんなも、\nファンのみんなも、大好きだヨ！", "zh": "我最喜欢家人、剧场的大家，\n还有所有粉丝了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "3985b0633f375a7a09873b1a99d489aad4760a9a0fb1482444c8078cd3f71cd2", "ja": "けど……そういう『好き』じゃないんだよネ？\nハルカ。ドキドキするほうの、好きな人？", "zh": "但是……不是那种“喜欢”吧？\n春香。是会让你心跳加速的那种喜欢的人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "8446b30beda6e09fb2d3943ee42a7b2f4eec3d2b51040139013da56cd49efaef", "ja": "うん、そう。もし、特定の……\n恋愛的な意味で、気になる人ができちゃったら……。", "zh": "嗯，是的。如果有了特定……\n在恋爱意义上很在意的人的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bda914ad106858e494c9a612f2c7a3d4b08e81b18329ca8c6494088721e52c4e", "ja": "恋愛的な意味で、ドキドキする相手かぁ。\nそりゃあ……できちゃったら、仕方ないんじゃない？", "zh": "恋爱意义上让人心动的人啊。\n要是……真的有了，那也是没办法的事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "f7fbc5e418d11d2e3af8ef5844d171de8d1005bd1395152f27af99b1fb7f0c81", "ja": "えっ！？　歩って、恋愛肯定派なんだね……。\nも、もしかしてもう、そういう相手が……！？", "zh": "诶！？原来步是恋爱肯定派啊……\n难、难道说已经有那种对象了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1be421a53ffe402c82a8c2aff598dfabf227ba892001c46a164e7681953b15a9", "ja": "い、いや、いない……よ！？　でも、好きな人が\nできるのって、自然なことだと思うし……。", "zh": "没、没有，没有啦……！？不过，我觉得\n喜欢上别人，也是很自然的事情嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "fa1aac4afc466bf746d0f7c4a298e19921e89e2d5420c833c490a94b60fbf3ca", "ja": "ワタシも、アユムと同じかナ？　もし好きな人が\nできたら……ガマンするのは、難しいかも。", "zh": "我也和步一样吗？如果有了喜欢的人……可能很难忍住吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "eaacc1c5a3f30c6f6d2006798186a14d1a8aeb4e5ea72f7a96f8e529ad87bb0b", "ja": "はわ～……み、みなさん、オトナですね……。\nあのっ、真さんはどう思いますか？", "zh": "哇……大、大家都是大人呢……。\n那个，真，你是怎么想的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "558820c10ed8ebe384c4030984963cebd37ef8d95cc592ea87a304206333e2ce", "ja": "うーん、そうだね。ボクも、恋には憧れてるし……\nはっきりした考えがあるわけじゃないんだけど。", "zh": "嗯——，确实呢。我也憧憬恋爱……\n虽然还没有什么明确的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "47200568926475ccf8c3c6d716cdfc2b1a703653880d020653c85b6f7243a280", "ja": "ただ、ボク達はアイドルだから。気にしなくちゃ\nいけないことは、普通の人よりあるのかも……って。", "zh": "不过，我们毕竟是偶像。有些必须在意的事情，或许比普通人更多……吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "79dc7bbe3a5ad520575d16f7cfda9dedcf951b310b420a651014d03534247863", "ja": "うん……。やっぱり、そうだよね。", "zh": "嗯……果然是这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "43505de3712521e087f20cad60540700e631588a421790e81cc072f955020e62", "ja": "有名な人とかだと、お付き合いしてるってだけで、\nニュースになったりしちゃいますもんね……。", "zh": "要是跟有名的人交往的话，光是这件事本身，\n就可能变成新闻什么的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f30f7b59230e53c9b98d7dad2b0b0738efdfba72fc9776945bfb90f013230892", "ja": "そういうの、イヤだよね。{$P$}も\n言ってたけど、アイドルにもプライバシーがあるっ！", "zh": "那种事，确实很讨厌呢。就像{$P$}说的，偶像也是有隐私的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c41bcf38165677ab81ea7901db95cae803208562082c1bdbbb36c28cbec3a728", "ja": "でも、応援してくれるファンの人たちに\nなんて説明すればいいかっていうと……難しいな～！", "zh": "不过，要说该怎么向支持我们的粉丝们解释……还真是难啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cbb6a93471582a304d8ac7bb28a08c997d5e30c0973e1971f370fbe408e5623d", "ja": "こういうのって、やっぱり\n筋を通さないといけないっていうか……。", "zh": "这种事，果然还是得讲道理才行……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "12e7735b02876bb049487a98f37f997c7df4a75da68c131c728127525e67156f", "ja": "筋を通す……って、具体的に、\nどうすればいいんでしょう？", "zh": "讲究原则……具体来说，该怎么做呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1027_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d42af23d363ed5267c22f1bb35874a7aaac418d06ecf7b97544ce4c72d2febff", "ja": "えっ！？　いや、それはその……こ、こういうのって\n難しい問題だから、アタシ達にはまだ早いかも！？", "zh": "诶！？不，那个……这、这种问题很复杂，对我们来说可能还太早了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "e030cd431751cfcf617ee120705f6a2c5ff659e6eaf4cbde8c7534ae5168338e", "ja": "そ、そうなんですね……！？\n確かに、れ、恋愛なんて、私にはまだ早いかも……！", "zh": "是、是这样啊……！？\n确实，谈、谈恋爱什么的，对我来说可能还太早了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "783f9da7a2122cc27d807245fa86cfdec486b0c61fc61c3849e569ee07ffa416", "ja": "バシッと答えが出せたらいいんだけど……。\nでも、そっか。春香、それで悩んでたんだ。", "zh": "要是能干脆地给出答案就好了……\n不过，这样啊。原来春香你是在为这个烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "170a559d26330c0d5da5e299d98ce07c76341fb19f851e3e7db0c1b9a0e7218c", "ja": "うん。……私は、あのお手紙をくれたファンの人に、\n答えられないって思ったんだ。", "zh": "嗯。……我觉得，我没法回答那位给我写信的粉丝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1031_001har", "source_sha256": "26666a695c86d81b976f3aa69ab67c2f51320575d21aee9d91fe864fe9cb1427", "ja": "あのお手紙の人が、本当に真剣だったとしても。\n私はあの人のことを、何も知らないから……。", "zh": "即使写那封信的人真的非常认真。\n因为我对那个人一无所知……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1032_018ele", "source_sha256": "aa2e60e81bd511266d8e93fdc287c44c2045dfb777806da609efc727b157b4b8", "ja": "ハルカ……。", "zh": "春香……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1033_001har", "source_sha256": "493f74509420e07d2edead4598c91e0b4198db5177f0192de4efbaa6865b27fa", "ja": "その時にね、ふと思ったの。もし私に、好きな人が\nできたら……アイドル続けていいのかな？　って。", "zh": "就在那时，我突然想到了。如果我有了喜欢的人……还能继续当偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1034_001har", "source_sha256": "202c6f053dac7963d82553ce1c8732aa45a86bdfe2acc81b26e6a292a70a7265", "ja": "みんなも言ってたみたいに、私も、ファンの人達には\n誠実でいたいって思うし。だから……。", "zh": "就像大家说的那样，我也希望能一直真诚地面对粉丝们。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1035_006mak", "source_sha256": "02a2ed23f7770840bbfe57a3bba026062c0a9f6ffc236aa069739f400e492b97", "ja": "そ、それは思い詰め過ぎだよ、春香。\nちょっと落ち着こう！", "zh": "那、那也想得太严重了，春香。\n先冷静一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1036_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b59cb43714148bf9dce1320ec82f7ebd1b5f7de669d08457d463cc1d5c96d9e6", "ja": "そうそう！　本当に恋してるってわけじゃなくて、\nただの可能性の話なんだから。", "zh": "对对！又不是真的恋爱了，只是在说这种可能性而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1038_036kan", "source_sha256": "6e1d3a3bef73baf6210e036c88485cfdbecd5d3af204f0c7e0459c1c66e327bf", "ja": "どうしたんですか、エレナさん？", "zh": "怎么了，艾蕾娜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1039_018ele", "source_sha256": "aa8b0d7303a6cbfd817d81747fb7e84fa4543409a645eb0b7440d68116b36109", "ja": "あ、ううん。ワタシも、前にみんなや\n{$P$}と、恋の話したんだけど。", "zh": "啊，没什么。我之前也和大家还有\n{$P$}聊过恋爱的话题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1040_018ele", "source_sha256": "e06eee87be2f836113fab37738a9248b4019d1c5064e52102b6fd87b984a171c", "ja": "でも{$P$}は、ワタシに\n『恋をしちゃいけない』とは言わなかったヨ。", "zh": "可是，{$P$}没有对我说\n“不能谈恋爱”哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1041_001har", "source_sha256": "43c4d53a1636d3e29af925ca0cce9702ebfaf49bca39c2acdade8925547abb54", "ja": "そうだったんだ……。\n{$P$}さんが……。", "zh": "原来是这样……。\n{$P$}先生竟然……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1043_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1044_p", "source_sha256": "60d8f67d5e516b813a31da4fc90ecb8c15cda94592d82dbdc2d7004c7bdb61db", "ja": "そうか、みんなでそういう話を……。\nいや、気にするのは当然だな。", "zh": "这样啊，大家都在聊这种事……\n不，确实应该在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1045_001har", "source_sha256": "0dd8e9196231baa87b471eda4223af5ff13767e232aeaa2e840561f4d190b877", "ja": "はい。……{$P$}さんは、\nどう思いますか？", "zh": "是的。……关于{$P$}先生，\n您是怎么想的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1046_p", "source_sha256": "e5b40e91b8d2f4ad3276184a262c8a6085a1d22469cbe72c14bc89aa2de64e1a", "ja": "アイドルだって、恋愛は自由だよ。\n……建前としては、って後ろについちゃうけどな。", "zh": "偶像也可以自由恋爱。\n……不过，后面总会跟着一句“这只是场面话”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1047_001har", "source_sha256": "8414eba2a68b143547a9975354cdbe0f0a74730f7f1346d6d2c3e3dd2c757618", "ja": "建前……。それじゃあ、本音は……？", "zh": "场面话……那、真心话呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1048_p", "source_sha256": "21311b942432660562b1904498c8316f85b649876b4734ecd5df89d6a2f45593", "ja": "プロデューサーという立場からの発言になるけど、\n難しいと言わざるを得ない。", "zh": "虽然这是站在制作人的立场上说的话，但不得不说，很困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1049_p", "source_sha256": "5610262ee9252e99a06ce78f47442e30ac72dde042ea929bf3fd116082b5bc08", "ja": "恐らく人気は下がるだろうし、活動はしにくくなる。\n実際のところは、そうなってしまうのが現状だ。", "zh": "恐怕人气会下滑，活动也会变得难以开展。\n而实际上的现状，就是会变成这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1050_001har", "source_sha256": "76331bf49742c12b0845adf40748a7739f32e14cf1fc00e4464fa7356939a115", "ja": "やっぱり、そうですよね……。", "zh": "果然，还是这样呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1051_p", "source_sha256": "10e081f8b03c858aa3855c7b9324c1bc4985a8bcf39de6a6be2e9c1046e2368e", "ja": "でも、制限するつもりはないよ。行動は制限できても、\n気持ちを制限する事はできないから。", "zh": "不过，我没打算限制你。即使可以限制行动，也无法限制心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1052_p", "source_sha256": "df375bf9b88aa8ba6802c78e019293950128486cc3e45d5c1f8cf141492eb0c2", "ja": "それに……人を好きになるのは、素敵な事だ。\nその気持ちは、大事にしてほしいと思う。", "zh": "而且……喜欢上一个人，是一件美好的事。\n我希望你能珍惜这份心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1053_001har", "source_sha256": "7c1fac7ece05c635834b827d11c0445de4b0b26b9eeb57baf6e083712fb9f289", "ja": "……はい。", "zh": "……好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1054_p", "source_sha256": "e0a29822b4025de7518d080dbfcc85db9d1a7107225e444ce64c599118bd0a7f", "ja": "発端は、やっぱりあの手紙の件かな。\n恋愛的な意味で、春香を好きだっていう……。", "zh": "事情的起因，果然还是那封信吧。\n是指恋爱意义上的……喜欢春香……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1055_001har", "source_sha256": "b40516919a0f945ef6413eed4921ce721e45b12295dab57f65fc24576bc48a94", "ja": "はい。……今までにも、ファンの人から\nそういう内容のお手紙をもらった事はあります。", "zh": "是的……以前也收到过粉丝寄来的\n表达这种感情的信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1056_001har", "source_sha256": "de815a1c5b6c8bac2678d57434fde905a64f67588d3a50c2e5cec9768ef66f96", "ja": "でも、今回は……あの人が、すごく\n本気なんだって感じてしまって。それで……。", "zh": "可是，这次……我感觉那个人是认真的。然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1057_p", "source_sha256": "31f6a39923de23e22475a81faf66ebc15995dbf618d8bf05b6163a342f9e2e77", "ja": "……春香は、その手紙をくれた彼に、\n何か言いたい事はあるのか？", "zh": "……春香对给你那封信的他，有什么想说的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1058_001har", "source_sha256": "eb2bd8faa1fc3c578f57fd3b65f7aa6e438afdbb051b1f59051a9aba4cacff6d", "ja": "ずっと考えていて……\n上手く伝えられるか、わからないんですけど……。", "zh": "我一直在想……\n虽然不知道能不能好好传达出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1059_p", "source_sha256": "01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69", "ja": "うん。", "zh": "嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1060_001har", "source_sha256": "6a7b74381ed2947322c2e1b57d45e18dfbba21994e356a1a520f1729863bc970", "ja": "恋人には、なれない、けど……アイドルとして、\nずっと傍にいるよって言いたいです。", "zh": "虽然成不了恋人，但是……我想作为偶像，\n对他说“我会一直陪在你身边”哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1061_001har", "source_sha256": "852c747668e544c535aa53bb5d79701d6b20aae75a84a564d73d3dfa804f9063", "ja": "もちろん、私がアイドルでいる限りですけど。\n……でも私、アイドルをやめるつもりはないので。", "zh": "当然，前提是我还会一直当偶像。\n……不过，我没有打算放弃偶像这份工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1062_p", "source_sha256": "0db41b5120c148a5fe8864ca0a04ee551ddb5476e11a60b887f657f695f3ae7d", "ja": "そうか。……しんどいぞ。", "zh": "这样啊。……会很辛苦的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1063_001har", "source_sha256": "9a68077ebedd34cc16e5582e9b608565976834e2432579a021bf5787dc6f4cfc", "ja": "それは、平気です。\n私にとっては、アイドルが一番なので。", "zh": "那没关系。\n对我来说，偶像才是最重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1064_p", "source_sha256": "e0d9ca69fa4ec044b6bde3b46a4c67feb8cb54dbf122536bd7fc6365151999a9", "ja": "わかった。……でも優先順位は、変わっていいと思う。\nだから、その時は教えてほしい。", "zh": "我明白了。……不过，我觉得优先顺序是可以改变的。\n所以，到时候请告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1065_001har", "source_sha256": "b72e5613148ee07c629ce084ec96aa097cc23dd91df0d869c56fb4f9508526f0", "ja": "え？　でも……。", "zh": "咦？但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1066_p", "source_sha256": "f3dd58a5548b863f36481ff2de18eea73ad98d3f8d203fc4250c40062c8e88b1", "ja": "アイドルであっても、ひとりの人間だからな。\n俺は、春香自身の気持ちを大事にしたい。", "zh": "即使是偶像，也只是一个普通人。\n我想珍惜春香自己的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1067_p", "source_sha256": "15eb47e8bff446118bc11459aecb6edc124d9965fd5bc0c9b0c7d36d9abfab23", "ja": "綺麗事かもしれないけど……。\nでも、覚えておいてほしい。", "zh": "也许这只是漂亮话……但希望你能记住。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1068_001har", "source_sha256": "3327a2bd7504f09168e2aaa2af980aa0aa2699d9df7b897dad02427105acc77f", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nありがとうございます。……ふふっ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n谢谢您。……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1069_p", "source_sha256": "8c04b2b285fb914a656341a45f90d7cb147c8bc8fb0b08f90601629ffe257e1f", "ja": "あ、あれ？　真面目に答えたつもりだけど、\n何かおかしかったかな……？", "zh": "啊、咦？我本来是想认真回答的，\n难道有什么不对吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1070_001har", "source_sha256": "792d2136a019f766977bfb71fa7d566d1cb370d8f8886d11546a379fe3222e73", "ja": "あっ、そうじゃないんです、すみません！\nただ……。", "zh": "啊，不是那样的，对不起！\n只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1071_001har", "source_sha256": "a2c6035c5e57694db5d0c737aa3c669594910647641c044bb6769c485de25710", "ja": "{$P$}さんが、\n私のプロデューサーさんでよかったな、って！", "zh": "我觉得能由{$P$}先生\n担任我的制作人，真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_124_1072_p", "source_sha256": "6f5373bff26f55802f75240253cb8710676ebab4073fc90536c6b80c4fb30b07", "ja": "そうか、ありがとう。俺も\n春香のプロデュースができて、光栄だよ！", "zh": "这样啊，谢谢你。我也很荣幸能负责春香的制作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
